# APK output

After `flutter build apk`, copy the APK into the repository root (`audio_guide/`), next to `README.md`. Name the fat release `audio_guide.apk`. Split ABI builds: `audio_guide-arm64-v8a-release.apk` (and similar). Do not leave the only copy on the Desktop. APKs are gitignored.
